---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="如何鑄造 POAP｜POAP 社群版">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <span class="eyebrow">鑄造 POAP</span>
    <h1 class="display-title mt-6 text-5xl sm:text-7xl">領取 POAP</h1>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="soft-card rounded-[2rem] p-7 sm:p-9">
        <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-leaf text-xl text-white">↗</span>
        <h2 class="mt-7 font-display text-3xl font-bold">使用錢包鑄造</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/58">輸入 ENS、Ethereum 地址或連接錢包；Gas 由協會支付，不需準備 ETH。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="soft-card rounded-[2rem] p-7 sm:p-9">
        <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gold text-xl text-white">@</span>
        <h2 class="mt-7 font-display text-3xl font-bold">使用 Email 領取</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/58">輸入 Email 並完成驗證，系統會自動建立或開啟錢包並完成鑄造；協會代付 Gas。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <a class="btn-primary mt-10" href="/#collection-search-section">查看我的收藏</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
